{"id":"b0d921f40c","t":"The Third-Generation Chaebol Takes Everything","c":"cv","n":11,"l":11,"s":["ml"],"k":{"ml":"the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything"},"u":1795188379758,"desc":"كان كيم مين جاي الحفيد المدلّل لإحدى عائلات التشايبول، غير أن شركة جدّه أفلست، وانتهى به المطاف ميتًا في ركنٍ من أركان سكن الطلاب. لكن القدر منحه فرصة ثانية؛ إذ عاد به الزمن إلى يوم كان فيه في السابعة عشرة من عمره، ليكتشف امتلاكه قدرةً عجيبة تمكّنه من الاطّلاع على المعلومات الشخصية للآخرين! لقد حانت فرصته لاستعادة حياته، وهذه المرة يعرف كيم مين جاي من يستحق الولاء، ومن يُخفي الخيانة خلف قناع الوفاء!","type":"","status":"OnGoing","genres":["اكشن","دراما","فانتازا"],"src":{"ml":"the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything"},"chapters":{"1":{"ml":"the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything|/manga/the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything/1/"},"2":{"ml":"the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything|/manga/the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything/2/"},"3":{"ml":"the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything|/manga/the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything/3/"},"4":{"ml":"the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything|/manga/the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything/4/"},"5":{"ml":"the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything|/manga/the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything/5/"},"6":{"ml":"the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything|/manga/the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything/6/"},"7":{"ml":"the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything|/manga/the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything/7/"},"8":{"ml":"the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything|/manga/the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything/8/"},"9":{"ml":"the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything|/manga/the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything/9/"},"10":{"ml":"the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything|/manga/the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything/10/"},"11":{"ml":"the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything|/manga/the-third-generation-chaebol-takes-everything/11/"}